### Export Label Sum

POST {{hostname}}/api/smartstable/export/label_sum/batch HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confidence_threshold": "0.0",
  "date_from": "2026-02-02",
  "date_until": "2026-03-28",
  "end_time": "05:00",
  "start_time": "19:00",
  "sum_labels": [
    "eating",
    "snoring",
    "drinking"
  ]
}


### Export Testset Bundle By Model Version

POST {{hostname}}/api/smartstable/export/testset/bundle HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model_version": "v29",
  "model_architecture": "panns",
  "snippet_duration_seconds": 4.0
}


### Publish Champion ONNX To Rclone

POST {{hostname}}/api/smartstable/champion/onnx/publish HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model_architecture": "panns",
  "publish_latest_alias": true
}


### Get Full Task Source JSON

GET {{hostname}}/api/smartstable/tasks/get-task-source?project_id=1&task_number=1 HTTP/1.1
